---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Terms & Conditions | SocioTool" description="Terms of service and liability disclaimers for SocioTool unit economics calculators.">
  <main class="w-full max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-12 md:py-20 overflow-x-hidden">
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-6 tracking-tight transition-colors">Terms & Conditions</h1>
    
    <p class="text-base md:text-lg text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-6 transition-colors">
      Welcome to SocioTool. By accessing or using our platform and calculators, you agree to comply with and be bound by the following Terms & Conditions.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100 mt-8 mb-4 transition-colors">1. Informational Purposes Only</h2>
    <p class="text-base md:text-lg text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-6 transition-colors">
      All formulas, platform metrics, and profit approximations generated by SocioTool are provided strictly for informational and educational purposes. While we strive to maintain accurate fee structures for all 47+ supported platforms, we are not a financial advisory service.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100 mt-8 mb-4 transition-colors">2. Exclusion of Liability</h2>
    <p class="text-base md:text-lg text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-6 transition-colors">
      E-commerce marketplaces and payment gateways frequently update their fee structures, surcharges, and tax policies. Under no circumstances shall SocioTool or its creators be held liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, or consequential financial losses resulting from business decisions made based on our calculator outputs. All financial and pricing decisions must be verified independently against official marketplace rate cards and your certified accounting professional.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100 mt-8 mb-4 transition-colors">3. Use of the Platform</h2>
    <p class="text-base md:text-lg text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-6 transition-colors">
      SocioTool is provided "as is" without warranties of any kind, either express or implied. You agree not to reverse-engineer, scrape, or systematically extract the mathematical architectures or proprietary source code that power our calculators without explicit written permission.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100 mt-8 mb-4 transition-colors">4. Third-Party Links</h2>
    <p class="text-base md:text-lg text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-6 transition-colors">
      Our website may contain links to third-party web sites or services that are not owned or controlled by SocioTool. We have no control over, and assume no responsibility for, the content, privacy policies, or practices of any third-party platforms.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100 mt-8 mb-4 transition-colors">5. Modifications</h2>
    <p class="text-base md:text-lg text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-6 transition-colors">
      We reserve the right to modify or replace these Terms & Conditions at any time. Material changes will be updated on this page. Your continued use of the platform after any such changes constitutes your acceptance of the new Terms.
    </p>
  </main>
</Layout>
